{
  "version": "shadowplay.story.v1",
  "title": "The Pterodactyl's Sky Ride",
  "beats": [
    {
      "id": "sky-title",
      "type": "chapter",
      "chapter": "The Pterodactyl's Sky Ride",
      "text": "The Pterodactyl's Sky Ride"
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-lamp",
      "type": "lamp",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-hello",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Tonight, {child|little one}, Mo is flying to the land of the dinosaurs, where the volcano sleeps."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-mo",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "arriving"
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-scenery",
      "type": "scenery",
      "set": "dino-valley"
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-mo-rests",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": -0.3,
      "restV": 0.12
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-intro1",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Stomp, stomp. The little long-neck dinosaur has climbed up a hill, to look at the stars."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-intro2",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "But now it is dark, and the little dinosaur cannot see the way back down to its cave."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-intro3",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Mo has an idea. Let's ask some dinosaur friends for help."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-want-trex",
      "type": "request",
      "shape": "trex",
      "text": "Make a T. rex: two flat hands, one on top of the other, like a big mouth."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-trex-yes",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "A T. rex! Big and gentle, with a tiny wave. Climb on, Mo."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-trex-ride",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "riding"
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-trex-carry",
      "type": "carry",
      "toU": 0.04,
      "text": "Stomp, stomp, down the hill."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-trex-land",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": -0.04,
      "restV": 0.08
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-trex-bows",
      "type": "release",
      "text": "The T. rex sits down by a fern, and yawns a great big yawn."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-dim1",
      "type": "lamp",
      "level": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-river",
      "type": "scenery",
      "set": "river"
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-fish-before",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Now there is a river, with stepping stones. Who can swim across?"
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-want-fish",
      "type": "request",
      "shape": "fish",
      "text": "Make a fish: a flat hand, fingers together, thumb tucked along the side.",
      "alt": "dog"
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-fish-yes",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "A fish! Fish swam in these rivers, long, long ago. Hop on, Mo."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-fish-ride",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "riding"
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-fish-carry",
      "type": "carry",
      "toU": 0.15,
      "text": "Swim, swim, across the river."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-fish-land",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": 0.12,
      "restV": 0.08
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-fish-bows",
      "type": "release",
      "text": "The fish swims off, and blows a sleepy bubble."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-valley-again",
      "type": "scenery",
      "set": "dino-valley"
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-dim2",
      "type": "lamp",
      "level": 0.7
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-pterodactyl-before",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "The cave is hidden somewhere among the tall ferns. Who can look from the sky?"
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-want-pterodactyl",
      "type": "request",
      "shape": "pterodactyl",
      "text": "Make a pterodactyl: two hands, side by side, like big wings."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-pterodactyl-yes",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "A pterodactyl! Up, up into the night sky. Climb on, Mo."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-pterodactyl-ride",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "riding"
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-pterodactyl-carry",
      "type": "carry",
      "toU": 0.3,
      "text": "Glide over the ferns. Look, there is the cave!",
      "minV": 0.12
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-pterodactyl-land",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": 0.26,
      "restV": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-pterodactyl-bows",
      "type": "release",
      "text": "The pterodactyl lands on the palm tree, and tucks in its wings."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-dim3",
      "type": "lamp",
      "level": 0.55
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-dark",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "The cave is just there. But inside, it is very dark."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-gift",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Look! A little firefly, glowing softly, just for us."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-want-cup",
      "type": "request",
      "shape": "cup",
      "text": "Cup your hands together, softly, and carry it to the cave."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-caught",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "You have it. Its light is warm and gentle."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-letgo",
      "type": "letgo",
      "text": "Now open your hands, and let the firefly light the cave."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-free",
      "type": "release",
      "text": "The cave glows warm, and there is the little dinosaur's cosy nest."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-finale",
      "type": "finale",
      "seconds": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-home",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "The little dinosaur stomps inside, curls up, and closes its eyes. Safe and snug."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-dim-last",
      "type": "lamp",
      "level": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-mo-sleep",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": 0.1,
      "restV": 0.15
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-goodnight",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Goodnight, little dinosaur. Goodnight, pterodactyl, up in the palm tree. And goodnight, {child|little one}. Mo will see you tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-the-end",
      "type": "chapter",
      "chapter": "The End",
      "text": "The End"
    },
    {
      "id": "sky-end",
